      "start_seconds": 88.0,
      "end_seconds": 93.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Right, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.16,
      "end_seconds": 102.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "It's alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week. I'm on iron tablets, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 103.63,
      "end_seconds": 112.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "she is supposed to take it once a day, but I can't say she always does"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.78,
      "end_seconds": 118.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
